# Allowlist: the image only COPYs from docker/ and python/ (llama.cpp comes
# from git in the Dockerfile), so send nothing else to the builder. This keeps
# models/ (tens of GB), state/ (hf_token, server.json) and .env out of the
# build context for good. A new COPY from elsewhere needs a "!path" line here.
*
!docker/
!python/

# ...and nothing generated inside those
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.log
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
